OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786004291
OL,3,CPC Harper's force considers joining
OL,4,Clegal challenge to block killers'
OL,5,Crelease
OL,7,FThames Valley Police Chief Constable
OL,8,FJames Hogg tells Good Morning Britain
OL,9,Fabout the impact of losing PC Harper
OL,10,Fin their force and why they are
OL,11,Fcalling on the government to ensure
OL,12,Fhis killers are not eligible for early
OL,13,Frelease
OL,15,FPC Andrew Harper's former police force
OL,16,Fis considering joining potential legal
OL,17,Faction against the government as his
OL,18,Fwidow backed a petition to block his
OL,19,Fkillers being released from prison
OL,20,Fearly.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786004291
OL,3,CPC Harper's force considers joining
OL,4,Clegal challenge to block killers'
OL,5,Crelease
OL,7,FAileen O'Connor, the chair of Thames
OL,8,FValley Police Federation, said the
OL,9,Fdecision to potentially release Jessie
OL,10,FCole and Albert Bowers under the
OL,11,Fgovernment's new early release policy
OL,12,Fwould impact the morale of serving
OL,13,Fofficers in the area.
OL,15,FPC Harper was a Thames Valley Police
OL,16,Fofficer when he was killed in August
OL,17,F2019 after responding to a quad bike
OL,18,Ftheft in Sulhamstead, Berkshire.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786004291
OL,3,CPC Harper's force considers joining
OL,4,Clegal challenge to block killers'
OL,5,Crelease
OL,7,FCole and Bowers are eligible for early
OL,8,Frelease as they were convicted of
OL,9,Fmanslaughter in 2020 and sentenced to
OL,10,F13 years, but could now be released
OL,11,Fhalfway through serving this sentence.
OL,13,FThis comes as the government announced
OL,14,Frape, serious child sex offences and
OL,15,Fgrooming will be excluded from
OL,16,Fupcoming cuts to prison sentences.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786004291
OL,3,CPC Harper's force considers joining
OL,4,Clegal challenge to block killers'
OL,5,Crelease
OL,7,FAndy Burnham said he "wanted to go
OL,8,Feven further" by expanding the
OL,9,Fexemptions to include manslaughter,
OL,10,Fbut that was not possible without the
OL,11,Fprison system collapsing and putting
OL,12,Fthe public "at much greater risk"
OL,14,FSpeaking to ITV News on Tuesday,
OL,15,FJustice Secretary Alex Norris
OL,16,Fapologised to the families affected by
OL,17,Fthe scheme, adding that they are
OL,18,F"carrying the can" for failures of
OL,19,Fprevious Conservative governments.
OL,26,@oD@VOUpD@MO]tD@LOUtD@aO]zD@AOUzD@RO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
