FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786004291
OL,3,CPC Harper's force considers joining
OL,4,Clegal challenge to block killers'
OL,5,Crelease
OL,7,FWriting in The Sun on Wednesday, Ms
OL,8,FO'Connor said she would "not forget
OL,9,Fthe government's inexplicable and
OL,10,Funforgivable decision to allow those
OL,11,Fwho kill police officers to be
OL,12,Freleased early from jail".
OL,14,F"We will throw everything at this
OL,15,Fthrough a proper legal challenge from
OL,16,FKCs, barristers, you name it. Our
OL,17,Fcolleagues will accept nothing less,"
OL,18,Fshe said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786004291
OL,3,CPC Harper's force considers joining
OL,4,Clegal challenge to block killers'
OL,5,Crelease
OL,7,F"It is a final betrayal from the
OL,8,Fpoliticians, who are supposed to be on
OL,9,Four side. A smack in the face to every
OL,10,Fone of us police officers across the
OL,11,FUnited Kingdom, who are out there now
OL,12,Frisking our lives to keep you, the
OL,13,Fpublic, safe," she added.
OL,15,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,16,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,17,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,18,Finbox every Friday morning.
