CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786004291
OL,3,CPC Harper's force considers joining
OL,4,Clegal challenge to block killers'
OL,5,Crelease
OL,7,FPC Harper's wife, Lissie, described
OL,8,Ffeeling "punched in the gut" at the
OL,9,Fprospect that her husband's killers
OL,10,Fcould be released early and supported
OL,11,Fa petition that started on Tuesday
OL,12,Fmorning.
OL,14,FMore than 150,000 people have signed
OL,15,Fthe petition in the past 24 hours
OL,16,Fdemanding the government takes action
OL,17,Fto keep the killers in jail.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786004291
OL,3,CPC Harper's force considers joining
OL,4,Clegal challenge to block killers'
OL,5,Crelease
OL,7,F"Hopefully we can make the current
OL,8,FGovernment come to their senses and
OL,9,Frealise we cannot put people like this
OL,10,Fback on our streets. Justice should
OL,11,Fmean justice and serving the sentence
OL,12,Fgiven," she said.
OL,14,FThe Times reported that historical
OL,15,Fchild sex abusers may still be
OL,16,Feligible for early release from
OL,17,Fprison, Burnham pledging to exclude
OL,18,Fthem.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@GO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
