PN,31909
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786004291
OL,3,CPC Harper's force considers joining
OL,4,Clegal challenge to block killers'
OL,5,Crelease
OL,7,FAccording to the report, the rules may
OL,8,Fnot apply to child sex offences that
OL,9,Ftook place before the law changed in
OL,10,F2003, even if the person found guilty
OL,11,Fwas brought to justice since then.
OL,13,FThe newspaper said Victims'
OL,14,FCommissioner for England and Wales
OL,15,FClaire Waxman is seeking clarification.
OL,17,FThe Prison Governors' Association
OL,18,F(PGA) has criticised the late change
OL,19,Fto the policy, saying it had put "huge
OL,20,Fpressure" on prison staff, making
OL,21,Fmistakes "more likely".
OL,26,@{D@bOU|D@IO]}D@JOU}D@VO]
